  "notes": [
    "Starting tasks is the same everywhere now: ▶ Start All, ▶ on a task and the right-click menu ask what to run, how many browsers at once and which webhooks get the results",
    "Clearer statuses and Discord posts: “Success” is now “Name Updated”, and posts say what happened, e.g. “Pickup Name Updated” or “Pickup Name Update Failed”",
    "Order Checker: the Order Checker tab is now part of Tasks — right-click → Check Order Status (or pick it in Start All). Your Order Checker orders are in your task list now",
    "Nothing is skipped any more: Start All runs every task, so you can re-check an order, change a name again or re-post to another webhook. View Log moved to the right-click menu"
  ],
